; Out of the vision slit. On Gun rather than on Turret for the same reason the
; tank's is: there is no crosshair aboard, so the arms are the aim, and a view
; that did not pitch with them would be pointing somewhere else entirely -- and
; these arms elevate to thirty degrees, twice what the tank's gun manages.
;
; Just outside the glacis rather than behind the slit itself. The plate is
; solid, and a camera behind it would spend the whole match looking at it.
[node name="CameraMount" type="Node3D" parent="Turret/Gun"]
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0.33, -0.85)

